RUN: %COMPILE_IR %S/guarded_return.cfc | %CHECK_IR %s

The guard's load, the branch and the early return share the return element's
location (order 0, line 1); the store carries the sink's (order 1, line 2).
CHECK: define void @guarded_return(ptr %0) !dbg ![[SP:[0-9]+]]
CHECK: %load_guard = load i8, ptr %guard, {{.*}}!dbg ![[RET:[0-9]+]]
CHECK: br i1 {{.*}}, !dbg ![[RET]]
CHECK: ret void, !dbg ![[RET]]
CHECK: store i32 42, ptr %result, {{.*}}!dbg ![[STORE:[0-9]+]]

CHECK-DAG: ![[DIAGRAM:[0-9]+]] = !DIFile(filename: "guarded_return.cfc.guarded_return"
CHECK-DAG: ![[RET]] = !DILocation(line: 1, scope: ![[LB:[0-9]+]])
CHECK-DAG: ![[LB]] = distinct !DILexicalBlock(scope: ![[SP]], file: ![[DIAGRAM]])
CHECK-DAG: ![[STORE]] = !DILocation(line: 2, scope: ![[LB]])
